# Internal dashboard state — read by the signal pipeline (data_loader.py ->
# C1/C3/C4/C5/C7) and monitored by health_monitor.sh, but must NOT be published:
# it carries raw Finnhub-verified prices (ToS redistribution) and legacy buy/sell
# labels. Lives under docs/ (the Pages-published dir) for historical reasons but
# stays untracked so it is never served. See data provenance audit 2026-06.
docs/data/
